      "raw": "<p>Apologies to the handful of you who have been waiting for this. It turns out that additional remote performers means additional wait times for submitted recordings. Submitted recordings with quality issues and other complications unique to each of them.</p><p>I&#39;ve had a few people reach out to me asking about this episode and, as of a couple of weeks ago, I received the last bits of dialogue I had been waiting for. I won&rsquo;t go spoiling any details of the episode, but the series of misfortunes, stumbling blocks, complications, delays, and eventual loss of all work that came along with this episode should have been foreseen.</p><p>That said, <strong>thank you</strong> for your interest in this project. If this episode is as well-received as the last, I&rsquo;ll keep at this. Frequent check-ins here should keep me on track with that, as well.</p><p>I&rsquo;ve got one last round of mixing to do over the course of this week, so hopefully I&rsquo;ll have something for you guys by either Friday or Saturday.</p><p>Better eat a couple of horseshoes and hang a black cat above the door just to be on the safe side, though.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
